  "description": "SEVXUO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C124 H236 Co4 Dy10 N10 O66 P12,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 3 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 3 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 3 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy10 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a branched tree with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.430-4.275 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.31-125.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C124H236Co4Dy10N10O66P12·2MeCN.",
